<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Precision Response cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Precision Response cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Thursday it cut its rating of Precision Response Corp to neutral from buy on an intermediate basis and to accumulate from buy on a long-term basis.</p>
<p>-- company said earlier it expects weak Q2 earnings after revenues from a pending sale were deferred to the third quarter.</p>
<p>-- stock dropped nearly 50 percent at the opening of trading, down seven to $8 from its Wednesday close at $15.</p>
</text>
